It is a pure-Bash command toolkit that gives AI coding agents a safety-first
repository interface (scoped search, context packing, guarded edits, rollback,
test selection, and verification). It shells out to optional third-party tools
when present — Git, ripgrep, jq, fd, GitHub CLI, Repomix, scc, and ShellCheck —
each of which remains under its own license.
